# Analysis outputs are regenerable and stay ignored, but the regression archive
# is the reference a model change is diffed against -- it has to be tracked.
!analysis/regression/baseline.json
# Study reports are generated by their `analysis/**/*_run.py` sweep -- the
# script is the source, the markdown is the output.  `study.md` links to them
# for full tables; regenerate with `python analysis/memory/<name>_run.py`.
*_report.md

# Worktrees live inside the repo and must never be committed into it.
.claude/worktrees/
